  "description": "Use shared AI contracts in middleware, RAG integrations and custom providers without depending on provider SDKs. Defines IAIService, optional Run/request-feature/image interfaces, messages, streaming events, tool contracts, typed image options, AIRunResult and immutable model-capability snapshots. Includes shared model identifiers and Perplexity Agent API contracts. Depends only on the lightweight Mythosia base package; paired with Mythosia.AI 8.0.0.",
