  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.0.0 supplies the contracts for Mythosia.AI 8.0.0. Major migrations: image options use enums and ImageSize instead of strings/separate AspectRatio; IAIService completion signatures append CancellationToken; AIRun.Result returns Task<AIRunResult>. Update custom implementations and rebuild consumers; ordinary completion still returns a string. Adds cancellation-aware tool handlers, explicit cancelled results, tri-state AI/image capabilities, current Claude/Gemini/Grok/DeepSeek and GPT Image 2.5 identifiers, and Perplexity Agent API contracts replacing legacy Sonar selections. Snapshots preserve supported JSON ownership, array bounds, read-only wrappers, dictionary comparers and shared references without adding a JSON dependency. Explicit provider token totals remain intact. Migration: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/docs/v8-migration.md Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/core/Mythosia.AI.Abstractions/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v400",
